header: "---\nname: jake-replica-replica-brand\ndescription: \"Names and rebrands an app clone so it is the user's own: name candidates with the trademark, domain, store and handle checks to run, a new palette checked for contrast, a logo brief, a voice guide, and a sweep tool that finds anything of the original left in the codebase. Use when the user says \\\"name my app\\\", \\\"rebrand the clone\\\", \\\"make it mine\\\", \\\"pick a name and colours\\\", \\\"logo brief\\\", \\\"brand voice\\\", \\\"check for leftovers\\\", or after /replica-entrepreneur. Always runs before /replica-launch.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/replica-skill\n  upstream_skill: replica-brand\n  upstream_commit: 77c9436fb3d18c3d58169efb8caf4fe906b0dc51\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
